{"suttaId":"thi-ap9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6812,6885],"vripara":"91"},"segments":{"thi-ap9:0.3":"Pañcadīpikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap9:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, cārikī [cāriniṃ (syā.)] āsahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap9:1.3":"Ārāmena ca ārāmaṃ, carāmi kusalatthikā.","thi-ap9:2.1":"“Kāḷapakkhamhi divase, addasaṃ bodhimuttamaṃ;","thi-ap9:2.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, bodhimūle nisīdahaṃ.","thi-ap9:3.1":"“Garucittaṃ upaṭṭhetvā, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","thi-ap9:3.3":"Somanassaṃ pavedetvā, evaṃ cintesi tāvade.","thi-ap9:4.1":"“‘Yadi buddho amitaguṇo, asamappaṭipuggalo;","thi-ap9:4.3":"Dassetu pāṭihīraṃ me, bodhi obhāsatu ayaṃ’.","thi-ap9:5.1":"“Saha āvajjite mayhaṃ, bodhi pajjali tāvade;","thi-ap9:5.3":"Sabbasoṇṇamayā āsi, disā sabbā virocati.","thi-ap9:6.1":"“Sattarattindivaṃ [sattarattidivaṃ (pī. ka.)] tattha, bodhimūle nisīdahaṃ;","thi-ap9:6.3":"Sattame divase patte, dīpapūjaṃ akāsahaṃ.","thi-ap9:7.1":"“Āsanaṃ parivāretvā, pañcadīpāni pajjaluṃ;","thi-ap9:7.3":"Yāva udeti sūriyo, dīpā me pajjaluṃ tadā.","thi-ap9:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap9:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap9:9.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, pañcadīpāti vuccati;","thi-ap9:9.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ [satayojanamubbedhaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)], tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ [saṭṭhi …(syā. pī.)].","thi-ap9:10.1":"“Asaṅkhiyāni dīpāni, parivāre jalanti me;","thi-ap9:10.3":"Yāvatā devabhavanaṃ, dīpālokena jotati.","thi-ap9:11.1":"“Parammukhā nisīditvā [puratthābhimukhā santi (syā.), puratthābhimukhā thitā (pī.)], yadi icchāmi passituṃ;","thi-ap9:11.3":"Uddhaṃ adho ca tiriyaṃ, sabbaṃ passāmi cakkhunā.","thi-ap9:12.1":"“Yāvatā abhikaṅkhāmi, daṭṭhuṃ sugataduggate [sukatadukkate (pī.];","thi-ap9:12.3":"Tattha āvaraṇaṃ natthi, rukkhesu pabbatesu vā.","thi-ap9:13.1":"“Asīti devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap9:13.3":"Satānaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap9:14.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","thi-ap9:14.3":"Dīpasatasahassāni, parivāre jalanti me.","thi-ap9:15.1":"“Devalokā cavitvāna, uppajjiṃ mātukucchiyaṃ;","thi-ap9:15.3":"Mātukucchigatā santī [mātukucchigataṃ santiṃ (sī.)], akkhi me na nimīlati.","thi-ap9:16.1":"“Dīpasatasahassāni, puññakammasamaṅgitā;","thi-ap9:16.3":"Jalanti sūtikāgehe [sūtighare pajjalanti (sabbattha)], pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap9:17.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, mānasaṃ vinivattayiṃ;","thi-ap9:17.3":"Ajarāmataṃ sītibhāvaṃ, nibbānaṃ phassayiṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap9:18.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassāhaṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","thi-ap9:18.3":"Upasampādayī buddho, guṇamaññāya gotamo.","thi-ap9:19.1":"“Maṇḍape rukkhamūle vā, pāsādesu guhāsu vā;","thi-ap9:19.3":"Suññāgāre vasantiyā [ca jhāyante (sī.), ca jhāyantā (pī.), pajjhāyantā (syā.)], pañcadīpā jalanti me.","thi-ap9:20.1":"“Dibbacakkhu visuddhaṃ me, samādhikusalā ahaṃ;","thi-ap9:20.3":"Abhiññāpāramippattā, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap9:21.1":"“Sabbavositavosānā, katakiccā anāsavā;","thi-ap9:21.3":"Pañcadīpā mahāvīra, pāde vandāmi [vandati (sī. ka.)] cakkhuma.","thi-ap9:22.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dīpamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap9:22.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap9:23.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap9:24.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap9:25.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap9:26.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ pañcadīpikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap9:27.1":"Pañcadīpikātheriyāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
